{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4ed782e75d71d0a4fa34e1f1547caf4526efc0fc4b5a0175c5b8748f73f092d8","ja":"ステキなおみせだね。\n連れてきてくれてありがとう、響さん！","zh":"真是家很棒的店呢。\n谢谢你带我过来，响小姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2080f2b9dc68a5d590e9746c6f9a6fa5258af3d4dd2bcca9bdfde27ec1176a1a","ja":"ふふん、遠慮しないで頼んでいいからね！","zh":"哼哼，不用客气，尽管点吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"86f99dffabfc372a7ae2d434493fa731f6ce584a6b156dc0b28c69f36d9b7cb0","ja":"（急いで調べたけど、いいところでよかったぞ～！\nちょっと高そうだけど……だ、大丈夫だよね……）","zh":"（虽然查得很匆忙，不过是个好地方真是太好了～！\n虽然看起来有点贵……应、应该没问题吧……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b891f2f8cf8ae8a8f7fb47816c35f7b78fcfb5f579793afc676ba2c45eab6121","ja":"おいしそうなのが、いっぱいだね！\nどれにしようかな～？","zh":"好多看起来很好吃的东西呀！\n选哪个好呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e9506b747dd7dacd899ae72c3742bddbae24ae484b2eaa0efe689112b348c83c","ja":"う～ん……あ、うさぎのクッキーが乗ってるパフェ、\nすっごく食べたいぞ！","zh":"嗯～……啊，好想吃上面\n放了小兔子饼干的芭菲啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0ec1aa1d7c087b6e1d7af1fd0d1ba7ca7d91d3c3048073941cd864debaf6f91d","ja":"でも、パンダのチョコが乗ったババロアも\nおいしそう……どうしよう、決められないぞ～！？","zh":"但是，放着熊猫巧克力的巴伐利亚布丁\n看起来也很好吃……怎么办，选不出来啦～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1fa626d2851bd085031409abdb20cfed7fe5a23c914fd90c5863218492409c86","ja":"じゃあ、みんなで分け合いっこしよ！","zh":"那我们大家一起分着吃吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"02b42c4074b06bb319aac6ffd0c27c6aa7b263fa37b8eb255519b8b2ae8bc0d1","ja":"うん、たまきも分け合いっこしたい♪\nひびきが食べたいの、たまきも食べたいから。","zh":"嗯，环也想分着吃♪\n响想吃的东西，环也想吃。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"945f559dbdc928efc80d17f0d0f69d7848394616fc9557fd750016d8240d3097","ja":"いいの？　わーい、ありがと……。","zh":"可以吗？哇——谢谢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"856d61fad54dcbfabcb85470e084ab53e4e869d7d9fde624394ea9bbe21ce96d","ja":"（はっ！　今の自分、全然お姉さんっぽく\nなかったぞ！？　これじゃあダメだ……）","zh":"（哈！刚才的我，完全没有大姐姐的\n样子啊！？这样可不行……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e8cc06ba48993e6ddcbdea05577c56e60f7ec989607d1b0596e6c0d86caffcff","ja":"すみませーん、注文お願いします。\nえっと、このパフェとババロアと……。","zh":"不好意思——麻烦点单。\n那个，要这个芭菲和巴伐利亚布丁，还有……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f7ec341ae6b65d7e1f59c50b586d57e46e7e22c842b0685aa6b7f471fcba95b6","ja":"たまき、みんなの分のお水を持ってきたぞ。","zh":"环把大家的水拿过来了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ed089fc4ac73a0c91a292fb57ddec7477805a48888847f9854b662152f01a6c8","ja":"あ、ふたりともありがと～……。","zh":"啊，谢谢你们两个～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1754.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"def941a38201f77c8ce017d50da007a7381c893b2945c311b239367f0a79b4f5","ja":"（……あれっ！\n注文もお水も、いつの間に……！？）","zh":"（……咦！\n点单和水，都在不知不觉间……！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
